==Strategy==
The enemies here are all quite weak except for The Face. Luckily, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] are able to outrange it and strike it from a safe distance. If the Doge Darks give you trouble, simply bring more meatshields and you should be good.

